{"seq":1,"slug":"the-essence-of-management","title":"The Essence Of Management","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/ideas-and-methods/the-essence-of-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-a-business","title":"企业是什么：创造顾客","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/ideas-and-methods/the-essence-of-management/what-is-a-business","wordCount":1887,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-customer-is-the-purpose","title":"做正确的事：效率与效能之辨","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/ideas-and-methods/the-essence-of-management/the-customer-is-the-purpose","wordCount":1659,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现德鲁克对管理之本质的深刻洞见。&quot;企业是什么&quot;——德鲁克以&quot;企业的目的是创造顾客&quot;的著名论断，纠正了&quot;企业以利润为目的&quot;的片面认识，并提出企业的两项基本职能是营销与创新。&quot;做正确的事&quot;——德鲁克深刻地区分了&quot;效率&quot;（正确地做事）与&quot;效能&quot;（做正确的事），强调方向比速度更重要、做正确的事比正确地做事更根本。本章揭示德鲁克管理思想的根本智慧。</p>\n"}